# Copy this file to .env (git-ignored) and fill the two values in YOUR EDITOR on the machine that runs the tool.
# Never paste a key or a secret into a chat, an issue, a pull request or a commit; no AI session handles real credentials (CLAUDE.md).
#
# Read by tools/r6_testnet_probe.py and, under the same names, by the offline operator tool (hy_operator_resolve --credentials-file):
# the READ-ONLY operator key of the Binance Spot Testnet (testnet.binance.vision), an HMAC-SHA256 key -- not the trading key.
# On Linux or WSL: chmod 600 .env
HENGYUAN_OPERATOR_TESTNET_API_KEY=
HENGYUAN_OPERATOR_TESTNET_API_SECRET=
